title: "Herdr /restart: exact close, new incarnation, original input custody"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Restart
    lg1: Breaks InputCustody
    lg2: Path to the AcceptedInputResolves or InputCustody bug
    lg3: Repeats forever, so AcceptedInputResolves breaks
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 breaks
  class lg2 bugPath
  class lg3 repeats
  s0: Old session and original queued input
  s1: Restart excludes old input and captures exact pane
  s2: Exact close confirmed#59; settle old inflight
  s3: Accepted input lost its owner
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: User /restart is accepted under transition and fence
  s1 --> s2: Close only the captured pane
  s2 --> s3: Retire and settle only the old token
  s3 --> s3: Commit new incarnation before create or Create reply is observed once or Evidence and binding admit the successor
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 blue
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 breaks
  class s3 bugPath
  class s3 repeats
